sequenceDiagram
    participant PS as Payment Service
    participant PG as PostgreSQL
    participant OW as Outbox Worker
    participant SQS as SQS Queue
    participant OS as Order Service
    participant DLQ as Dead Letter Queue

    Note over PS: Payment verified and confirmed
    PS->>PG: BEGIN TX: Insert payment and outbox_event PaymentSucceeded
    PG-->>PS: TX Committed

    OW->>PG: Poll outbox_events WHERE status = PENDING
    PG-->>OW: Return PaymentSucceeded event
    OW->>SQS: Publish message M1 to SQS queue
    OW->>PG: UPDATE outbox_event SET status = PUBLISHED

    Note over OS: Order Service is DOWN: ECS task restarting for 30 seconds
    SQS->>OS: Attempt delivery of M1: consumer offline
    Note over SQS: Visibility timeout expires at 30 seconds
    SQS->>OS: Redeliver M1 attempt 2: consumer offline

    Note over OS: Order Service recovers at T plus 30s: ECS task healthy
    SQS->>OS: Redeliver M1 attempt 3: Order Service UP

    Note over OS: Idempotent Consumer Processing
    OS->>PG: Query order WHERE reservation_id = id
    alt Order already confirmed by previous worker
        PG-->>OS: Existing confirmed order row
        OS-->>SQS: ACK message deduplicated
    else First delivery processing
        OS->>PG: UPDATE order SET status = CONFIRMED
        OS->>PG: INSERT outbox_event OrderConfirmed
        PG-->>OS: Transaction Committed
        OS-->>SQS: ACK message successfully consumed
        Note over OS: Triggers BlueDart logistics and customer notification
    end

    Note over SQS,DLQ: If consumer keeps failing beyond maxReceiveCount
    SQS->>DLQ: Route poison message to DLQ after 5 failed retries
    Note over DLQ: Ops team alerts on DLQ depth greater than zero
